er board for the best rewards.\r\n\u2012 Tower climbing system to challenge bosses of all levels and acquire rare resources.\r\n\r\n*** Auto-Battle System ***\r\n\u2012 Set your lineup of dinosaurs before you\u2019re away, and they will keep fighting when you are offline!\r\n\u2012 Collect idle rewards and resources without spending too much time every day\r\n\u2012 \"Tap game mechanics\" let you level up combat power with just a touch of the screen in this  idle clicker game.\r\n\r\nIf you are a super fan of idle clicker games, arcade games, cultivation& level-up games, action RPG games, and role-playing games, then don\u2019t miss this \"Legends of Monster: Idle RPG\"- the most fun game perfect  for Busy Bees. Become a ganit Kaiju and unleash chaos now!",
